<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Mayor Andrew J. Ginther invites you to celebrate Priscilla R. Tyson with a ceremony to formally name the Cultural Arts Center in her honor.</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Friday, Oct. 7, 2022, at 11 a.m.<em><br></em>Cultural Arts Center<br>139 W Main St.<br>Columbus, OH 43215</p>
<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Space is limited. Please RSVP <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeX669HDeD4mxOjWGH9qH1Rs6EOclgT275_3EpCly6xQ_DGSg/viewform?c=0&flr=0&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery&vc=0&w=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">here</a>.</p>
<table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;"><tr><td align="center"><img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2022/09/6420563/4317767/savethedate-png_crop.png" style="width: 560px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Save the date invitation on Oct. 7 at 11am at the cultural arts center" width="560" height="790"></td></tr></table>
